<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="540055021"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:40.107" ttm:agent="v2"><div begin="20.287" end="37.723" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="20.287" end="24.926" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.287" end="21.447">开个玩笑</span> <span begin="21.447" end="22.680">别太认真</span><span begin="22.680" end="24.085">我只是天生</span><span begin="24.085" end="24.926">幽默</span></p><p begin="25.161" end="28.355" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.161" end="25.711">干嘛</span><span begin="25.711" end="26.401">这样</span> <span begin="26.401" end="27.477">转过头不</span><span begin="27.477" end="28.355">理我</span></p><p begin="30.051" end="34.720" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.051" end="31.135">好吧 宝贝</span> <span begin="31.135" end="32.308">是我哪里</span><span begin="32.308" end="33.830">做错说错加</span><span begin="33.830" end="34.720">搞错</span></p><p begin="34.977" end="37.723" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.977" end="36.685">冷静一下别发</span><span begin="36.685" end="37.723">火</span></p></div><div begin="38.921" end="48.356" itunes:songPart="PreChorus" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="38.921" end="43.707" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.921" end="39.238">不要</span><span begin="39.238" end="40.657">生气</span> <span begin="41.294" end="43.707">我说一百次对不起</span></p><p begin="43.827" end="48.356" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.827" end="44.180">不要</span><span begin="44.180" end="45.590">叹气</span> <span begin="46.104" end="48.356">吵架甚么了不起</span></p></div><div begin="48.396" end="1:09.750" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="48.396" end="53.095" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="48.396" end="49.604">我说</span><span begin="49.604" end="53.095">男生的无所谓都是自以为</span></p><p begin="53.367" end="58.022" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="53.367" end="53.891">我们</span><span begin="53.891" end="54.443">女</span><span begin="54.443" end="57.548">生一回一回都在给你机</span><span begin="57.548" end="