/p><p begin="2:16.030" end="2:17.452" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="2:16.030" end="2:17.452">真的是很胡闹欸</span></p><p begin="2:18.692" end="2:20.230" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="2:18.692" end="2:19.267">我不想</span><span begin="2:19.267" end="2:20.230">听</span></p><p begin="2:20.437" end="2:22.386" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="2:20.437" end="2:21.796">你说了又做不到我为什么要</span><span begin="2:21.796" end="2:22.386">听</span></p><p begin="2:22.737" end="2:26.347" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="2:22.737" end="2:23.693">我不要听 我不要</span><span begin="2:23.693" end="2:24.135">听</span> <span begin="2:24.135" end="2:25.223">真的快要被你气死</span><span begin="2:25.223" end="2:26.347">了</span></p></div><div begin="2:27.850" end="2:38.335" itunes:songPart="Bridge"><p begin="2:27.850" end="2:30.170" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:27.850" end="2:29.279">是不是不够</span><span begin="2:29.279" end="2:30.170">爱我</span></p><p begin="2:30.343" end="2:32.531" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:30.343" end="2:32.008">是不是不了解</span><span begin="2:32.008" end="2:32.531">我</span></p><p begin="2:32.774" end="2:38.335" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:32.774" end="2:34.577">是不是我说的</span><span begin="2:34.617" end="2:35.745">没进你耳</span><span begin="2:35.745" end="2:38.335">朵</span></p></div><div begin="2:38.636" end="3:02.043" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:38.636" end="2:43.305" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:38.636" end="2:39.844">我说</span><span begin="2:39.844" end="2:43.305">男生的无所谓都是自以为</span></p><p begin="2:43.571" end="2:48.226" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:43.571" end="2:44.095">我们</span><span begin="2:44.095" end="2:44.647">女</span><span begin="2:44.647" end="2:47.752">生一回一回都在给你机</span><span begin="2:47.752" end="2:48.226">会</span></p><p begin="2:48.415" end="2:53.058" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:48.415" end="2:48.980">请你</span><span begin